                <li>To attach a file, choose it and click <b>Add Attachment</b>. Repeat for each additional file; attached files are listed below the buttons. Click <b>Clear All</b> to remove them.</li>
                <li>Click <b>Send Email</b>. Outlook will open a draft addressed to the support team with any attachments included.</li>
            </ol>

            <h3>3. Category 2</h3>
            <ol>
                <li>Click <b>Category 2</b> at the top.</li>
                <li>Pick the tab that matches the issue: Enter Your Tab 1 Here, Enter Your Tab 2 Here, Enter Your Tab 3 Here, Enter Your Tab 4 Here, or Enter Your Tab 5 Here.</li>
                <li>Fill in the ticket number, error message, list of tickets, and user location.</li>
                <li>If you have a log file, attach it. If not, you can paste the log text in the box instead.</li>
